    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Tectonic Fragdrill",
    "summary": "For as long as the only units from your army within **Engagement Range** of an enemy unit are **FORTIFICATION** units, that enemy unit:\n\n- can still be picked as a target for ranged attacks, but each such attack not made with a Pistol gets -1 to its **Hit roll**\n- has its models skip **Desperate Escape tests** when they **Fall Back** while it is **Battle-shocked**, apart from any model whose move crosses enemy models",
